{"id":"n80376-1-8","stage":4,"title":"추리다 · 拣出","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80376-1-8-1","ko":"이 상자는 뭐예요?","zh":"这个盒子是干什么的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"상자는","meaning":"箱子","explanation":"상자：箱子；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"상자","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62801","senseId":"1","lemma":"상자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상자는","audio":"/audio/4cb54e571296e1b48e8a.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐예요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐예요","audio":"/audio/4f5cef3090eaab6a16ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"e6bb1dea433d8fa4","term":"상자","zh":"箱子","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3","entryId":"62801","definition":"存放东西的木制或纸制四方形筒。","pronunciation":["상자"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/dc0b4c93fada181371c1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80376-1-8-2","ko":"부모님께 갖다 드리려고 알이 굵은 감자만 추린 거예요.","zh":"这是特意挑了颗粒较大的土豆，准备送给父母们的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"부모님께","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母；께：에게 的敬语形式，表示“给、向、对”某位受尊敬的人。","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부모님께","audio":"/audio/465c92fdbfbdfbc191ef.mp3"}},{"text":"갖다","meaning":"用，拿","explanation":"갖다：用，拿；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"갖다","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29738","senseId":"13","lemma":"갖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갖다","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3"}},{"text":"드리려고","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드리려고","audio":"/audio/d5caac5e12edcc91a01f.mp3"}},{"text":"알이","meaning":"卵，粒","explanation":"알：卵，粒；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"알","audio":"/audio/63251c05b0dbf37fa9f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74893","senseId":"7","lemma":"알","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알이","audio":"/audio/1292ab1e8d8a97a3970d.mp3"}},{"text":"굵은","meaning":"大，粒大，饱满","explanation":"굵다：大，粒大，饱满；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"굵다","audio":"/audio/f0e74315d7de77f237b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89458","senseId":"2","lemma":"굵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"굵은","audio":"/audio/7295fa896d4e2c3eafa4.mp3"}},{"text":"감자만","meaning":"马铃薯，土豆","explanation":"감자：马铃薯，土豆；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"감자","audio":"/audio/33f260e0ceece725d98e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85863","senseId":"1","lemma":"감자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감자만","audio":"/audio/9da5f52fe9264ee29f10.mp3"}},{"text":"추린","meaning":"拣出，挑选","explanation":"추리다：拣出，挑选；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"추리다","audio":"/audio/b8cff17ebcba74a44f74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId"